	Trying, for once, to actully complete a game WITH
the accompaniment of my original pet, I grabbed a whistle when
I found one. Ordinary whistles are of little use, since your
pet takes its own sweet time strolling over to you when you
blow it. I noticed particularly how badly the whistle worked
(though it seemed to work better when I rewarded my dog with
tripe when he finally showed up) and that the game message
said "You produce a high whistling sound."
	So imagine my surprise when my pet started appearing
by my side instantly, and the game message became "You produce
a strange whistling sound." Clearly, what I have now is a
magic whistle. But why didn't it work before? Does my character
have to be of a certain level to make a magic whistle work?
Do whistles change to magic ones if blown often enough? 
I really am pretty sure I have been using the same whistle
throughout the game. If anyone has had a similar exeperience,
please post!

